{
  "displayName": "${EGRESS_DENIAL_ALERT_DISPLAY_NAME}",
  "combiner": "OR",
  "enabled": true,
  "conditions": [
    {
      "displayName": "Any egress denied by the ${GATEWAY_NAME} gateway in a 5-minute window",
      "conditionThreshold": {
        "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/${EGRESS_DENIAL_METRIC}\"",
        "aggregations": [
          {
            "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
            "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
            "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
          }
        ],
        "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
        "thresholdValue": 0,
        "duration": "0s",
        "trigger": {"count": 1}
      }
    }
  ],
  "documentation": {
    "mimeType": "text/markdown",
    "content": "An agent bound to `${GATEWAY_NAME}` attempted egress that IAP or the gateway denied: a write tool (`add_progress_note`), a tool with no `roles/iap.egressor` grant for that principal, or an unregistered destination.\n\nTriage:\n1. Gateway log: `resource.type=\"networkservices.googleapis.com/Gateway\" AND resource.labels.gateway_name=\"${GATEWAY_NAME}\" AND httpRequest.status=403` (read `httpRequest.requestUrl`, `jsonPayload.agentGatewayInfo.mcpInfo`).\n2. IAP decision: `protoPayload.serviceName=\"iap.googleapis.com\" AND protoPayload.authorizationInfo.permission=\"iap.resources.egressViaIAP\"` (read `authorizationInfo.granted`, `authenticationInfo.principalSubject`, `labels.\"iap.googleapis.com/audited_resource_name\"`).\n3. Expected during the 09-demo.sh write-tool beat; unexpected otherwise. A run of denials means a manipulated agent or a policy regression."
  }
}
